WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,080
I agreed

2
00:00:01,440 --> 00:00:05,660
Don't worry, please take action quickly.

3
00:00:05,900 --> 00:00:07,660
Sons of the Fire Tribe

4
00:00:07,660 --> 00:00:10,020
Let the people of Tamu tribe see it

5
00:00:10,020 --> 00:00:14,850
What does it mean to be a true warrior?

6
00:00:14,850 --> 00:00:16,090
What about Li Shi Ni?

7
00:00:16,450 --> 00:00:18,210
I am half a fairy

8
00:00:18,210 --> 00:00:20,450
But you can't deal with the real fairy

9
00:00:20,450 --> 00:00:21,530
You support him

10
00:00:21,530 --> 00:00:24,730
I'll deal with these little rats from Da Qin first.

11
00:00:24,730 --> 00:00:26,770
You can still save some brothers

12
00:00:26,770 --> 00:00:27,940
If you stay

13
00:00:28,260 --> 00:00:30,420
Faced with half of Immortal Heaven and Tashan joining forces

14
00:00:30,420 --> 00:00:32,420
He'll probably die here
